# A content pack: one .ecfg file, a pack:: header that says who it is, and content tables. Nothing
# else - no manifest file, no directory layout, no code.
#
# The pictures below are ordinary PNGs next to this file: the art style is polygonal, the resource is
# an image. The engine resolves and checks every image path when the pack loads.
pack::
    id:"base_pack"
    name:"Base pack"
    version:"2.0"
item::
    pack_ore::
        note:"placeholder content: the real tables come from the designer"
        image:"art/floor.png"
structure::
    pack_floor::
        image:"art/floor.png"
